WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:01.089
THIS!

00:00:01.089 --> 00:00:02.089
CHANGES!

00:00:02.089 --> 00:00:03.089
EVERYTHING!

00:00:03.089 --> 00:00:08.179
The One Piece manga just started the MOST
HYPED FLASHBACK because for the very first

00:00:08.179 --> 00:00:13.550
time we learn what actually happened on the
legendary island God Valley.

00:00:13.550 --> 00:00:19.619
And wow, Oda really knows how to take everything
that we thought we knew and throw it right

00:00:19.619 --> 00:00:20.619
in the trash.

00:00:20.619 --> 00:00:26.730
Because this island is INSANE and ABSOLUTELY
changes everything we thought we knew about

00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:31.820
the legendary battle between the former pirate
king Gol D. Roger and the infamous pirate

00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:33.300
Rocks D. Xebec.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:38.110
But that is FAR FROM the only incredible reveal
in this chapter because we also learned that

00:00:38.110 --> 00:00:44.430
the Celestial Dragons are hands down the most
scum-bag group of characters I have EVER SEEN

00:00:44.430 --> 00:00:51.360
in any STORY, and even Shanks’ Dad or Uncle,
whoever this guy is, is just as bad as the

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:52.530
rest of them.

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:58.879
Then there’s the possibility that we JUST
MET LUFFY’S MOM!!!

00:00:58.879 --> 00:01:05.290
What’s just as crazy though is that we finally
learned EXACTLY what is so special about Bartholomew

00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:09.610
Kuma’s race, where Kuma might have gotten
his incredible devil fruit, and how his lineage

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:14.180
directly ties back to Nika from the distant
past.

00:01:14.180 --> 00:01:19.350
And speaking of the past, we saw more of Saint
Saturn’s mind-blowing abilities, which are

00:01:19.350 --> 00:01:27.950
super powerful and seem to break all sorts
of rules, and I honestly have so many questions

00:01:27.950 --> 00:01:29.700
about his mysterious powers.

00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:34.670
And let’s start with Saint Saturn because
he showed off some truly unbelievable powers

00:01:34.670 --> 00:01:38.062
right at the start of the chapter.

00:01:38.062 --> 00:01:42.030
First, he brushed off having a sword stabbed
into his chest like it was nothing.

00:01:42.030 --> 00:01:49.060
And not only that, but the blood disappeared
as if nothing had even happened at all.

00:01:49.060 --> 00:01:50.060
Like, what???

00:01:50.060 --> 00:01:55.970
We’ve only seen one devil fruit in the entire
story that lets you heal yourself, so if Saturn

00:01:55.970 --> 00:02:01.920
has some sort of healing powers, that instantly
makes him a HUGE THREAT.

00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:07.219
I have to wonder though, is this ability because
of his demon transformation?

00:02:07.219 --> 00:02:12.530
Which again to be clear, we still don’t
know if this is an actual devil fruit or if

00:02:12.530 --> 00:02:17.170
he is truly just some sort of demon creature.

00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:21.610
But the fact that Vegapunk just clearly shouts
out that it must be a devil fruit power makes

00:02:21.610 --> 00:02:26.720
me kinda think that it is more likely than
not that he is just straight up a devil.

00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:31.310
Man, I’m getting chills just thinking about
the fact that we are finally getting to see

00:02:31.310 --> 00:02:32.310
this guy in action.

00:02:32.310 --> 00:02:39.560
But I do have an idea about a potential weakness,
which we’ll discuss in just a moment.

00:02:39.560 --> 00:02:43.959
Before we get distracted though, Saturn’s
healing was just the first ability he showed

00:02:43.959 --> 00:02:51.000
off, because then he busted out his evil looking
eye powers to damage both Bonney and Sanji.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:56.560
And while I’m still not too clear what this
power is, it seems like this is some sort

00:02:56.560 --> 00:02:58.860
of special projectile attack.

00:02:58.860 --> 00:03:04.890
Maybe like an invisible haki bullet or just
some kind of demonic ability.

00:03:04.890 --> 00:03:09.810
Whatever it is though, it is insanely powerful
because it actually drew blood from both Bonney,

00:03:09.810 --> 00:03:13.470
and more impressively, Sanji.

00:03:13.470 --> 00:03:19.670
Which is a massive feat because remember that
Sanji’s body is now ridiculously powerful.

00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:26.320
I mean he tanked this massive sword from Kaido’s
second commander and even this full force

00:03:26.320 --> 00:03:30.030
attack from the overpowered Seraphim without
even flinching.

00:03:30.030 --> 00:03:38.040
So just making Sanji bleed shows just the
raw power of even this basic attack from Saint

00:03:38.040 --> 00:03:39.040
Saturn.

00:03:39.040 --> 00:03:44.709
Now, at this point I was hoping Sanji might
stand a chance against Saturn, but I was dead

00:03:44.709 --> 00:03:52.379
wrong because just moments later Saturn somehow
freezes everyone with his mysterious powers.

00:03:52.379 --> 00:03:57.220
Which is just like wow, how is he doing this?

00:03:57.220 --> 00:04:02.670
These are powerful fighters too, but they
are literally helpless against the Celestial

00:04:02.670 --> 00:04:03.670
Dragon.

00:04:03.670 --> 00:04:07.450
And now I’m wondering, can Saturn even be
killed?

00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:12.670
I mean later on in the chapter we seem to
get even more evidence for the “Gorosei

00:04:12.670 --> 00:04:17.030
are immortal theory” because during the
flashback at God Valley, which we’ll break

00:04:17.030 --> 00:04:22.850
down in just a moment, he basically looked
unchanged from that time to now.

00:04:22.850 --> 00:04:28.790
And I know people in the One Piece world usually
live a lot longer than real life, but come

00:04:28.790 --> 00:04:29.790
on!

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:35.160
Thirty-eight years is a pretty long time to
not look any different at all.

00:04:35.160 --> 00:04:43.380
So I think we’re once again on the side
of “the Gorosei are immortal beings”.

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:46.940
That doesn’t mean they can’t be killed
though, and Saturn’s comment from the last

00:04:46.940 --> 00:04:53.030
chapter about not coming down to the surface
in a long time makes me wonder if they don’t

00:04:53.030 --> 00:04:56.930
come down from Mary Geoise because of one
particular weakness.

00:04:56.930 --> 00:05:04.070
And that would of course be the sea, which
is basically the enemy of all devil fruit

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:06.110
users.

00:05:06.110 --> 00:05:11.350
So assuming he has a devil fruit or that his
devil form is also considered an enemy of

00:05:11.350 --> 00:05:17.500
the sea, forcing Saturn into the ocean could
be one way to kill him.

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:23.410
It is certainly possible, and after Saturn
straight up told Kizaru that he was a disappointment,

00:05:23.410 --> 00:05:29.930
I’m wondering if we could see the admiral
pick up his boss and just dump him in the

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:30.930
ocean.

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:34.940
Just a theory, but with all the set up of
Kizaru being a slave, I would love to see

00:05:34.940 --> 00:05:52.690
him break those chains and take out Saint
Saturn.

00:05:52.690 --> 00:05:59.460
But speaking of slaves, let's discuss the
MIND-BLOWING TRUE NATURE of God Valley.

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:03.730
Now, there are three MAJOR CHANGES that we
just have to talk about.

00:06:03.730 --> 00:06:06.350
The first is: What is God Valley?

00:06:06.350 --> 00:06:11.590
Second, the characters involved in this epic
and also tragic event.

00:06:11.590 --> 00:06:15.259
And the third is about one particular little
red-haired kid.

00:06:15.259 --> 00:06:19.330
Let’s kick it off with, what even is this
place?

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:24.000
Because ever since chapter 1057 when Sengoku
revealed the legendary battle between the

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:29.910
pirate king Gol D. Roger and the famous pirate
Rocks D. Xebec took place at God Valley, I

00:06:29.910 --> 00:06:34.940
think pretty much everyone assumed that God
Valley was some sort of home island for the

00:06:34.940 --> 00:06:36.150
Celestial Dragons.

00:06:36.150 --> 00:06:37.530
But NOPE!

00:06:37.530 --> 00:06:39.400
WE WERE ALL WRONG!

00:06:39.400 --> 00:06:47.639
Turns out this island was its own kingdom
that happened to offend the world government.

00:06:47.639 --> 00:06:53.240
So because of this, it was chosen thirty-eight
years ago to be the site of a bloodthirsty

00:06:53.240 --> 00:06:57.490
tournament where a bunch of slaves and the
people who already lived on God Valley are

00:06:57.490 --> 00:07:00.590
all hunted down like animals.

00:07:00.590 --> 00:07:07.120
Wow, if you didn’t already hate these spacesuit
wearing world nobles, then surely you do now.

00:07:07.120 --> 00:07:12.410
But that’s not all we learned because apparently
this slave-hunting tournament used to take

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:15.080
place every three years.

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:21.460
Which, hold on, if they have been doing this
ever since the Void Century 800 years ago,

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:29.819
that would mean they have taken over or eliminated
around 254 islands with this sick tournament,

00:07:29.819 --> 00:07:32.790
not including the last 38 years.

00:07:32.790 --> 00:07:57.020
I mean sheesh, how is it even possible they
are that evil?

00:07:57.020 --> 00:08:00.910
Of course, we don’t know the full story
though, and I’m wondering if they stopped

00:08:00.910 --> 00:08:04.960
this tradition after the events of God Valley
because we have not heard of this tournament

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:09.000
before and we also know that God Valley was
essentially wiped off the map.

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:13.810
So it’s possible that whatever happened
here was so awful for the world government

00:08:13.810 --> 00:08:16.870
that they decided to never hold the tournament
again.

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:22.009
Plus, Saint Saturn was clearly at God Valley,
but then he said he hadn’t been to the surface

00:08:22.009 --> 00:08:28.680
in a long time, so maybe this particular tournament
was the last time he was down on the surface.

00:08:28.680 --> 00:08:33.560
But now I just have to know was that catastrophic
event that made them end the tournament.

00:08:33.560 --> 00:08:37.250
And we’ll discuss more about that in just
a moment, but first I want to talk about the

00:08:37.250 --> 00:08:42.990
main people who we absolutely know were involved
in this event, including a confirmed epic

00:08:42.990 --> 00:08:47.550
one on one battle that we never knew about!

00:08:47.550 --> 00:08:52.580
And starting with the person who seems to
be the main villain of this flashback, the

00:08:52.580 --> 00:08:54.540
holy Knight, Figarland Garling.

00:08:54.540 --> 00:09:00.399
In case you forgot, he is this guy, and it
now seems more likely than ever that he is

00:09:00.399 --> 00:09:06.310
truly Shanks dad, since they look so incredibly
similar.

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:09.690
Or if not his dad, maybe Shanks uncle or something.

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:14.230
But apart from killing the original king of
God Valley, Garling is expected to be the

00:09:14.230 --> 00:09:20.800
champion of this slave-hunt, which we can
assume means that he is clearly the most powerful

00:09:20.800 --> 00:09:22.770
of the world nobles participating.

00:09:22.770 --> 00:09:28.630
But now that we know his appearance is SO
similar to Shanks’ it puts a whole new context

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:30.370
on this panel right here.

00:09:30.370 --> 00:09:35.540
Because while we’ve never really thought
that Shanks gave Whitebeard some scars in

00:09:35.540 --> 00:09:40.340
battle, it's possible now that Whitebeard
fought against Garling during the battle on

00:09:40.340 --> 00:09:41.399
God Valley.

00:09:41.399 --> 00:09:46.300
We know that Whitebeard was present there
because he was a part of the Rocks crew at

00:09:46.300 --> 00:09:50.630
that time, so I think there is a very good
chance we could see Garling attacking Whitebeard

00:09:50.630 --> 00:09:53.209
when Rocks does eventually attack.

00:09:53.209 --> 00:10:01.050
And man, if Garling is giving Whitebeard scars,
then this man is no joke and should be a devastatingly

00:10:01.050 --> 00:10:02.800
powerful fighter.

00:10:02.800 --> 00:10:08.589
I for one would give anything to see a full
out fight between these two!

00:10:08.589 --> 00:10:14.161
However, talking about Rocks brings up the
next interesting point, because you have to

00:10:14.161 --> 00:10:18.370
keep in mind that we were told by Sengoku
that the Rocks pirates attacked God Valley

00:10:18.370 --> 00:10:23.800
and were only defeated by the combined power
of Roger, and the hero of the marines, Garp.

00:10:23.800 --> 00:10:29.730
But now I’m wondering how much of that is
actually true, if any.

00:10:29.730 --> 00:10:35.250
Because now that we know that God Valley wasn’t
just the home of Celestial Dragons, we have

00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:39.570
to ask: why did Rocks attack God Valley in
the first place?

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:41.800
Was he trying to free the slaves?

00:10:41.800 --> 00:10:47.350
Or was this tournament with so many of the
Gorosei in one place just the perfect opportunity

00:10:47.350 --> 00:10:50.470
for Rocks to wipe out the world nobles?

00:10:50.470 --> 00:10:57.269
Both seem like reasonable options, but why
then would Roger join the fight to stop Rocks?

00:10:57.269 --> 00:11:02.000
Surely, Roger would have hated the Celestial
Dragons as well.

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:04.570
And he wouldn’t have stopped them from freeing
the slaves.

00:11:04.570 --> 00:11:07.600
So it has to have been something else, right?

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:12.380
Well, there was one other thing we were told
from this chapter, which was that God Valley

00:11:12.380 --> 00:11:15.700
was home to some very valuable natural resources.

00:11:15.700 --> 00:11:18.790
Now, we weren’t told what that was.

00:11:18.790 --> 00:11:23.880
It could be the incredibly rare Sea Stone,
or maybe gold.

00:11:23.880 --> 00:11:28.940
Another incredible option is from chapter
434 and the same conversation between Whitebeard

00:11:28.940 --> 00:11:33.420
and Shanks where Shanks says he brought some
Whitebeard some wine from his hometown in

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:34.420
the West Blue.

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:40.630
Which is basically now confirmed to be God
Valley, but interestingly Shanks also calls

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:46.290
this wine “Medicinal Water”, or basically
healing water, so what if God Valley is a

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:49.110
place where magical water naturally appeared?

00:11:49.110 --> 00:11:53.720
Certainly seems like a solid option, especially
because right after drinking the wine, Whitebeard

00:11:53.720 --> 00:11:55.730
gets up and clashes with Shanks.

00:11:55.730 --> 00:12:00.120
Seems like some pretty good healing water
if you ask me.

00:12:00.120 --> 00:12:04.170
But that’s not even the most interesting
option in my opinion because God Valley might

00:12:04.170 --> 00:12:07.760
have been the original home of the devil fruits.

00:12:07.760 --> 00:12:12.699
We’ve already speculated in past videos
that Rocks attacked God Valley in order to

00:12:12.699 --> 00:12:19.010
take powerful devil fruits, but I think this
whole situation both supports and also somewhat

00:12:19.010 --> 00:12:20.940
opposes this theory.

00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:25.430
Because first off, if this was where devil
fruits were created, then why wouldn’t the

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:29.360
world government or some other super powerful
force come and take them?

00:12:29.360 --> 00:12:33.870
They didn’t seem to have too much trouble
taking over the kingdom for this tournament,

00:12:33.870 --> 00:12:35.860
so why not in the past?

00:12:35.860 --> 00:12:38.139
So that’s one point against this idea.

00:12:38.139 --> 00:12:43.160
On the other hand, we know that Kaido only
got his devil fruit after the battle at God

00:12:43.160 --> 00:12:44.160
Valley.

00:12:44.160 --> 00:12:48.990
And the same could also be true for Whitebeard,
who as far as we know didn’t have his fruit

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:50.600
before this battle.

00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:54.810
Plus after this chapter we know of at least
one more character who could have gotten their

00:12:54.810 --> 00:13:01.209
overpowered devil fruits during the battle
of God Valley.

00:13:01.209 --> 00:13:19.540
I’m of course talking about Kuma, who might
have found his broken Paw-Paw fruit after

00:13:19.540 --> 00:13:24.529
he was released on this island with a bunch
of other slaves to be hunted down by the Celestial

00:13:24.529 --> 00:13:25.540
Dragons.

00:13:25.540 --> 00:13:32.990
And wow, if anyone predicted this twist then
I hereby name you the king of one piece theories,

00:13:32.990 --> 00:13:36.550
because I for one never saw this twist coming.

00:13:36.550 --> 00:13:42.710
But that’s just the start of the incredible
reveals we got about Kuma!

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:45.010
Man, I feel like I keep saying that.

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:49.650
Has this really all just been one chapter???

00:13:49.650 --> 00:13:55.009
Anyway, first off we learned that Kuma is
from a race of people called the Buccaneers.

00:13:55.009 --> 00:14:00.250
If you’re not familiar, this is a term used
to describe pirates who mostly attacked Spanish

00:14:00.250 --> 00:14:03.100
colonies in North America during the 17th
century.

00:14:03.100 --> 00:14:07.871
Which to me means that this race was likely
connected with the Ancient Kingdom, who were

00:14:07.871 --> 00:14:10.180
almost definitely pirates.

00:14:10.180 --> 00:14:16.630
We also learned that this race is a mix of
human and giant blood, which is how Kuma came

00:14:16.630 --> 00:14:21.089
to have their ridiculous size and strength,
at least compared to normal humans.

00:14:21.089 --> 00:14:26.741
I’m also now wondering if this is true of
other freakishly tall humans we’ve seen

00:14:26.741 --> 00:14:29.589
all throughout the story like Big Mom and
Whitebeard.

00:14:29.589 --> 00:14:34.220
But to further support the idea that the Buccaneer’s
were allies of the Ancient Kingdom, we are

00:14:34.220 --> 00:14:40.520
told that the legend of Nika is passed down
through the Buccaneer members and that Kuma

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:46.769
even knew both the name and the SAME EXACT
DRUM RHYTHM that Nika’s heartbeat makes.

00:14:46.769 --> 00:14:52.740
So this could be why Kuma was SO DETERMINED
to help Luffy back in Sabaody when he both

00:14:52.740 --> 00:14:58.459
saved the crew from Kiazru and protected their
ship during the timeskip.

00:14:58.459 --> 00:15:00.730
Man, this chapter is insane.

00:15:00.730 --> 00:15:02.160
And we aren’t even done.

00:15:02.160 --> 00:15:05.730
Because once the world government learned
that Kuma’s family is a race the world government

00:15:05.730 --> 00:15:07.120
hunts down because once they learned Kuma
had the Buccaneer bloodline, his entire family

00:15:07.120 --> 00:15:09.810
was enslaved and taken to Mary Geoise.

00:15:09.810 --> 00:15:13.880
Which of course led to Kuma’s father and
mother's deaths and Kuma eventually being

00:15:13.880 --> 00:15:26.600
thrown into the slave-hunting tournament on
God Valley.

00:15:26.600 --> 00:15:34.019
This might not actually have been the worst
thing for him though because this is where

00:15:34.019 --> 00:15:38.890
we see him eventually meet up with the future
Revolutionary Army member, Ivankov, and a

00:15:38.890 --> 00:15:41.060
brand new character named Ginny.

00:15:41.060 --> 00:15:48.259
And okay, let’s take a deep breath here
because wow, this is just even more fuel for

00:15:48.259 --> 00:15:49.259
speculation.

00:15:49.259 --> 00:15:52.610
This moment right here could very well be
the origin of the Revolutionary Army.

00:15:52.610 --> 00:15:56.079
Which means that Luffy’s father, Dragon,
might also be showing up on God Valley very

00:15:56.079 --> 00:15:57.079
soon.

00:15:57.079 --> 00:16:00.180
Just, yeah, let’s just keep pouring more
gas onto this chaotic fire.

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:06.290
However, I for one am super curious about
Ginny and the insane possibility that she

00:16:06.290 --> 00:16:11.949
could be Luffy’s mom.

00:16:11.949 --> 00:16:16.290
I mean, you might think it’s crazy, but
look, she is literally eating meat.

00:16:16.290 --> 00:16:20.170
If that is not solid evidence that this is
Luffy’s mom, I don’t know what is.

00:16:20.170 --> 00:16:22.300
Oh man, my head is going to explode right
now.

00:16:22.300 --> 00:16:26.350
Though if this is Luffy’s mom, we probably
won’t be seeing her for very long, since

00:16:26.350 --> 00:16:30.960
moms pretty much never survive backstories.

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:47.880
Moving on though, if Kuma did indeed find
his devil fruit on this island, then his ability

00:16:47.880 --> 00:16:52.130
to push people across the world would be the
perfect way for them to eventually escape

00:16:52.130 --> 00:16:55.730
the all out war that is coming to the island
very soon.

00:16:55.730 --> 00:17:00.310
Before we completely dive off the deep end
though, there is even more to discuss, because

00:17:00.310 --> 00:17:04.589
while we brought up Garling’s presence on
this island, there is one piece to all this

00:17:04.589 --> 00:17:06.620
that is just incredibly strange.

00:17:06.620 --> 00:17:11.640
That’s because we were told that Roger picked
up baby Shanks from a treasure chest.

00:17:11.640 --> 00:17:16.120
So if this wasn’t actually Garling’s home,
then why was Shanks here?

00:17:16.120 --> 00:17:18.010
Was Shanks’ mom also here?

00:17:18.010 --> 00:17:20.410
Or did Garling have Shanks with him?

00:17:20.410 --> 00:17:24.660
Did Roger just randomly steal some treasure
and Shanks just happened to be in a chest

00:17:24.660 --> 00:17:26.049
like Uta from film Red?

00:17:26.049 --> 00:17:30.220
Or did someone like Garp find Shanks and give
him to Roger for protection?

00:17:30.220 --> 00:17:34.820
Which would be fitting since it is the exact
inverse of when Roger asked Garp to look out

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:37.320
for Ace after he turned himself into the marines.

00:17:37.320 --> 00:17:45.620
And this could completely change how we think
of Shanks, his future role in the story, and

00:17:45.620 --> 00:17:50.030
even his mysterious meeting with the Gorosei,
